    example: "Reference: the real room, window on the left, mug sitting on the table with one soft contact. Generate the host there, eyes sharp, crop including the window, the nose, and the mug. Compare on a phone. Keep the still where the nose shadow and the mug shadow fall right, and the chair leg has a short contact. Reject the version with the shadow falling into the window, or with the mug floating. Regenerate from the reference with one cool window and shadows falling away from it.",
