    example: "Reference: your photo of the real plain jar, blank label, white or clear lid, on the table. Generate both adult hands around that jar, thumbs on the lid, daylight from the left, one shadow to the right, fingers sharp, crop at the wrists. Compare on a phone and count. Keep the still where each nail sits on its own finger and the label has no invented word. Reject the waving version from the first try. Regenerate from the jar photo with the hands given that one job.",
