    example: "Reference: this host's real hairline in daylight, no cutout edge. Generate a profile to a bright kitchen window, three strands crossing the glass, the rest of the edge soft, rim light only on the window side, eye sharp, crop at the shoulders. Compare on a phone. Keep that still. Reject the version with a grey halo all the way around the head. Regenerate from the reference with flyaways named and the far side left darker.",
    bridge: "Lock the hairstyle with the face in Scro, then keep it. A pose or wardrobe change should not redraw the hairline. If the edge halos, reject the still and regenerate. It is not ready for a talking clip. Trim the opening silence, caption in one of 13 styles, and export 9:16. Label the realistic face as AI. A cartoon is a different case.",
