    bridge: "Approve the glasses in the Scro still before the mouth moves. A later pose edit should keep this face, including the frames, unless you deliberately change the accessory. Trim the opening silence. Captions have 13 styles. Export 9:16 only after the eyes are visible. Label the realistic face as AI. A cartoon is a different case.",
